  "labels": ["pasninkas", "PenktadienioReceptai"],
  "hero": "https://web.archive.org/web/20210921163743im_/https://1.bp.blogspot.com/-9GANygrae30/YSe-IrSKHPI/AAAAAAABQkM/Q-2hjlW9P2srYAPD8NH_t9rOuHM0qYRIQCLcBGAsYHQ/w1200-h630-p-k-no-nu/20210826_174213.jpg",
  "html": "<div><div><a href=\"https://1.bp.blogspot.com/-9GANygrae30/YSe-IrSKHPI/AAAAAAABQkM/Q-2hjlW9P2srYAPD8NH_t9rOuHM0qYRIQCLcBGAsYHQ/s2611/20210826_174213.jpg\" imageanchor=\"1\" rel=\"noreferrer\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"148\" src=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20210921163743im_/https://1.bp.blogspot.com/-9GANygrae30/YSe-IrSKHPI/AAAAAAABQkM/Q-2hjlW9P2srYAPD8NH_t9rOuHM0qYRIQCLcBGAsYHQ/s320/20210826_174213.jpg\" width=\"320\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></a></div><br></div><div><b>Laikas:</b> Apie 30-40 min</div><div><b>Kaina:</b>&nbsp;Vidutinė</div><div><br></div><div><b>Jums reikės:&nbsp;</b></div><div>1 l vandens</div><div>150 g sauso sojų faršo</div><div>12 tortilijų (paplotėlių)<br></div><div>3 pomidorai</div><div>3 agurkai</div><div>2 svogūnai</div><div>15 g kalendrų</div><div>~100 g kininių kopūstų</div><div>Konservuotų raudonųjų pupų</div><div>Konservuotų kukurūzų</div><div>1-2 šauktai pomidorų padažo</div><div>1-2 kubeliai daržovių sultinio</div><div>Buritų prieskonių (tinka druska, pipirai, paprikos, kuminai, imbieras, česnakai, raudonėliai... galima nusipirkti mišinį)</div><div><br></div><div><i>Gaminimui prireiks kontaktinio grilio ar panašaus prietaiso, kad apkepintume tortiliją.</i></div> <div><b><br></b></div><div><b>Paruošimas:</b></div>1. Paruošiame faršą.<div><br><div>Užverdame vandenį. Įdedame du sultinio kubelius.</div><div>Į verdantį sultinį sudedame sausą sojų faršą.</div><div><br></div><div><a href=\"https://1.bp.blogspot.com/-b8x8-wd60Dw/YSe-r-L1CoI/AAAAAAABQkY/LiLxwGE_bfoVanLSWrS2KPI_H3ZsAXmzwCLcBGAsYHQ/s2048/IMG_20210826_170346_2.jpg\" imageanchor=\"1\" rel=\"noreferrer\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"320\" src=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20210921163743im_/https://1.bp.blogspot.com/-b8x8-wd60Dw/YSe-r-L1CoI/AAAAAAABQkY/LiLxwGE_bfoVanLSWrS2KPI_H3ZsAXmzwCLcBGAsYHQ/s320/IMG_20210826_170346_2.jpg\" width=\"320\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></a></div><div><br></div><div>Verdame apie 10 min.</div><div>Po to, įkaitiname keptuvę su aliejumi ir kepame faršą joje. Kiek apkepę, sudedame prieskonius, dar pakepame. Dar pakepę dedame 1-2 šaukštus pomidorų (arba čili, jei mėgstame aštriau) padažo.</div><div><br></div><div><a href=\"https://1.bp.blogspot.com/-TFR4j-_KFDw/YSe-_IWqNmI/AAAAAAABQkg/N_BEK6LJBHkzUMcmtYHLUVjxM1sXYS93gCLcBGAsYHQ/s2048/IMG_20210826_172223_2.jpg\" imageanchor=\"1\" rel=\"noreferrer\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"320\" src=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20210921163743im_/https://1.bp.blogspot.com/-TFR4j-_KFDw/YSe-_IWqNmI/AAAAAAABQkg/N_BEK6LJBHkzUMcmtYHLUVjxM1sXYS93gCLcBGAsYHQ/s320/IMG_20210826_172223_2.jpg\" width=\"320\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></a></div><br><div>2. Išverdame ryžius. Aš mėgstu naudoti plikytus.</div><div><br></div><div>3. Nuplovę, smulkiname daržoves, visus ingredientus galime patogiai išsidėlioti aplinkui</div><div><br></div><div><a href=\"https://1.bp.blogspot.com/-3rRfRmDYlL0/YSe8rD8ymCI/AAAAAAABQjs/9yggPI4Hftsv_-ryHCJjJ83nS2YsUf-2gCLcBGAsYHQ/s2048/IMG_20210826_173326.jpg\" imageanchor=\"1\" rel=\"noreferrer\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"240\" src=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20210921163743im_/https://1.bp.blogspot.com/-3rRfRmDYlL0/YSe8rD8ymCI/AAAAAAABQjs/9yggPI4Hftsv_-ryHCJjJ83nS2YsUf-2gCLcBGAsYHQ/s320/IMG_20210826_173326.jpg\" width=\"320\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></a></div><div><br></div><div>Žinoma, šiuos tris žingsnius galima daryti vienu metu, taip ženkliai sutaupant laiko.</div><div><br></div><div>4. Dedame ingridientus į buritą. Pagardiname mėgstamu padažu</div><div><br></div><div><div><a href=\"https://1.bp.blogspot.com/-8Cz1YqRQh_I/YSe8QpCKIyI/AAAAAAABQjk/et0iuejubfM3Z2gG9-UEfqpVa9EQsvSAQCLcBGAsYHQ/s2611/20210826_173605.jpg\" imageanchor=\"1\" rel=\"noreferrer\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"148\" src=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20210921163743im_/https://1.bp.blogspot.com/-8Cz1YqRQh_I/YSe8QpCKIyI/AAAAAAABQjk/et0iuejubfM3Z2gG9-UEfqpVa9EQsvSAQCLcBGAsYHQ/s320/20210826_173605.jpg\" width=\"320\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></a></div><div><br></div></div><div>5. Sukame buritą</div><div><br></div><div><a href=\"https://1.bp.blogspot.com/-_cyUUrnhDTw/YSe6AfEVEiI/AAAAAAABQjY/xKJZks6EkxMn2NeMskW3n-g0yFr1UrB1wCLcBGAsYHQ/s2611/20210826_173611.jpg\" imageanchor=\"1\" rel=\"noreferrer\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"148\" src=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20210921163743im_/https://1.bp.blogspot.com/-_cyUUrnhDTw/YSe6AfEVEiI/AAAAAAABQjY/xKJZks6EkxMn2NeMskW3n-g0yFr1UrB1wCLcBGAsYHQ/s320/20210826_173611.jpg\" width=\"320\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></a></div><br><div><a href=\"https://1.bp.blogspot.com/-whwS4gLZHQA/YSe6AScznyI/AAAAAAABQjU/vW5MU2bJNSEss8pE3bKZ2NJkL9eO4-3YgCLcBGAsYHQ/s2611/20210826_173616.jpg\" imageanchor=\"1\" rel=\"noreferrer\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"148\" src=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20210921163743im_/https://1.bp.blogspot.com/-whwS4gLZHQA/YSe6AScznyI/AAAAAAABQjU/vW5MU2bJNSEss8pE3bKZ2NJkL9eO4-3YgCLcBGAsYHQ/s320/20210826_173616.jpg\" width=\"320\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></a></div><br><div><a href=\"https://1.bp.blogspot.com/-4uz72BU-Ctw/YSe6ARqNJ9I/AAAAAAABQjQ/B0k2nczRRhQXODDZ6Pv10C8xmojt9iUyQCLcBGAsYHQ/s2611/20210826_173622.jpg\" imageanchor=\"1\" rel=\"noreferrer\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"148\" src=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20210921163743im_/https://1.bp.blogspot.com/-4uz72BU-Ctw/YSe6ARqNJ9I/AAAAAAABQjQ/B0k2nczRRhQXODDZ6Pv10C8xmojt9iUyQCLcBGAsYHQ/s320/20210826_173622.jpg\" width=\"320\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></a></div><div><div><br></div></div><div>6. Apkepame kontaktiniame grilyje.</div><div><br><div><a href=\"https://1.bp.blogspot.com/-ONE57DtN1N4/YSe9nYD0NmI/AAAAAAABQj4/z24DA-gw4HcugY2dHD0BcBd-ptTjOXq8gCLcBGAsYHQ/s2048/IMG_20210826_175903.jpg\" imageanchor=\"1\" rel=\"noreferrer\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"320\" src=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20210921163743im_/https://1.bp.blogspot.com/-ONE57DtN1N4/YSe9nYD0NmI/AAAAAAABQj4/z24DA-gw4HcugY2dHD0BcBd-ptTjOXq8gCLcBGAsYHQ/s320/IMG_20210826_175903.jpg\" width=\"240\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></a></div><div><br></div>7. Patiekiame. Jeigu kepame didesnį kiekį, galime susukti į foliją, kad buritai ilgiau išliktų karšti.</div><div><br></div><div><a href=\"https://1.bp.blogspot.com/-TsYzVpx5zfs/YSe9k2VD9SI/AAAAAAABQj0/d4uZgTX4C1Ibg1eIv2iJc9EQ0tQ5iMy0wCLcBGAsYHQ/s2048/IMG_20210826_174204.jpg\" imageanchor=\"1\" rel=\"noreferrer\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"240\" src=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20210921163743im_/https://1.bp.blogspot.com/-TsYzVpx5zfs/YSe9k2VD9SI/AAAAAAABQj0/d4uZgTX4C1Ibg1eIv2iJc9EQ0tQ5iMy0wCLcBGAsYHQ/s320/IMG_20210826_174204.jpg\" width=\"320\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></a></div></div>",
